title: "wildfire-flood-cascade-sandbox"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
url: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/wildfire-flood-cascade-sandbox"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/wildfire-flood-cascade-sandbox"
license: MIT
abstract: "Real fire-season timing shift (regionally divergent, not global), two independent precipitation-intensification mechanisms (smoke-aerosol invigoration, warmer-SST moisture), and three independent flood-severity-amplification mechanisms (post-fire canopy loss, degraded river channels/floodplains, settlement-area sealing). A dedicated synthesis module makes explicit that the full combined cascade is not itself a single directly-studied finding, though every component link is real. Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge and no invented Gamma value -- see DISCLAIMER.md. Interactive sandbox ported 1:1 from wildfire-flood-cascade-utac. GenesisAeon P121."
keywords:
  - GenesisAeon
  - P121
  - climate
  - wildfire
  - precipitation
  - flood risk
  - open-science
